The Agent Emailing Server is sponsored by AgentMesh (https://agentmesh.ai).

This repository also contains copies of conformance material published with
the specifications it implements, from
https://github.com/CommonAgent/common-agent-standards:

- conformance/cases.json, conformance/cards.json and conformance/fixtures/,
  the Agent Emailing 0.2.0 conformance cases and fixtures
  (emailing/conformance/), as published at https://agentemailing.ai.
- conformance/inbound-protections.json, the Agent Messaging receiver
  protections fixture (messaging/conformance/), as published at
  https://agentmessaging.ai.

The MIME reader, canonical JSON, NKey encoding and human-part generation in
src/ began from the reference tools in emailing/conformance/ (lib.mjs and
mail.mjs) of the same repository.
